Z||000022||StuGood||09-01-2000||03:40 PM||||If it dies (engine+ electrically)completely,  suddenly, out of nowhere, it's probably a connection or link.<P>If it were a loose alternator belt, it would ordinarily die a slow death, as the battery becomes discharged.      ||||reg||1
